# Movia configuration reference (no secrets)

Backend: PARSER_HOST and PARSER_PORT are consumed by backend/config.py.
TMDB_API_KEY is private and must be provided through the Termux environment or
private .env.

MCP: TERMUX_MCP_HOST, TERMUX_MCP_PORT, TERMUX_MCP_SECRET, TERMUX_MCP_ROOTS and
TERMUX_MCP_JOB_ROOT are consumed by agent/mcp/src/config.ts.

Native agent: provision its token through agent/tools/provision-agent-token.sh.

Runtime catalog: MOVIA_CATALOG_DB may point scripts/create-baseline.sh at the
private catalog DB.